        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion RH-B9, Traditional Rope Mount Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith one of the most classic styles in home hardware, the Oval Rope Rose Robe Hook is great for traditional homes. This beautiful robe hook is available in medium bronze (pictured), antique pewter, brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished brass finishes, all of which really seem to highlight the rope detailing along the edged on the mount. Of course this robe hook isn't just for bathrobes. Install one near the front door to hang bags and outerwear. Put one in your closet to keep your accessories organize. Or even hang one in the pantry for your apron. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-bar-fusion-tb-b9\"><b>Fusion TB-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-ring-fusion-tr-b9\"><b>Fusion TR-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-b9\"><b>Fusion PH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Oval Rope Trim Robe Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
